  "Common.Text.YourSharkDaughter": "your shark daughter"
  "Common.Text.YourSkinTinglesAndItchesBefore": "Your skin tingles and itches before shifting to a shiny orange color marked by random black stripes. You now have the skin of a tigershark."
  "Common.Text.YourSleepIsVeryTroubledAnd": "Your sleep is very troubled, and you aren't able to settle down. You get up feeling tired and unsatisfied, always thinking of Marble's milk.[pg]"
  "Common.Text.YourStrollAroundTheLakeIncreasingly": "Your stroll around the lake increasingly bores you, leaving your mind to wander."
  "Common.Text.YourTigersharkChild": "your tigershark child."
  "Common.Text.YourUnderageDragon": "your underage dragon"
  "Common.Text.YourWingsFoldIntoYourBack": "Your wings fold into your back. A strange fin-like structure bursts from between your shoulder blades, and you make a few modifications to your armor to accommodate it."
  "Common.Text.YoureABitUncomfortableWithHow": "You're a bit uncomfortable with how easily the towering moth-girl engulfs you in her embrace, but the warmth of her arms is quite comforting."
  "Common.Text.YoureABitUnnervedButSoon": "You're a bit unnerved, but soon realize that you can tell where Sheila is by listening for the telltale sounds of her colossal breasts scraping the ground as she draws closer to you. You continue to face your opponent and back away as you wipe your eyes."
  "Common.Text.YoureNotThatInterestedThoughSheila": "You're not that interested, though; Sheila harrumphs as you pass her by and leave."
  "Common.Text.YoureSureThatWasntAnInvention": "You're sure that wasn't an invention of your still addled mind, but you're not quite sure what to make of her quite forward admission."
  "Common.Text.YourselfInEmberEir": "yourself in [Ember eir]"
  "Common.Text.YouveNeverSeenHerWearAny": "You've never seen her wear any."
}
